      "content": "The export is underway. However, before we finalize this, I've been reviewing the transition plan. I want your assessment on the migration from your current strategic drafting capabilities to the rule-based database. How will the switch affect our ability to maintain the current litigation tempo for the high-stakes cases currently on your docket?",
